      "spam": false,
      "value": "As of right now, the position of head and body, is placed far further on others' views, than it is one the one who is laying down.  Top this off with IPD scaling being an issue (as meentioned:  https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/base-ipd-scale-adjustment )\n\nIt causes one to also float.  There is a work around to get me close to the ground, BUT... that method does not work with FBT (Full Body Tracking)  and even with FBT, I float and cannot adjust.  Other avatars with cartoonishly long arms will sink into the floor.  anime characters, typically long legged females will float.\n\nTechnically though... you DO lay down, but it's still poorly implemented.",
